# route: level=w7_l1 difficulty=beginner ends=exit after=tally expect=min_checkpoints:4,letters:3
# The Beginner club route of Shell Beach (designer D7; recorded from closed-loop macros, build/d7/bot_w7_l1.gd).
# Boards every raft from its bank, paddles it into the surf current and rides it to the next bar; the two
# blowholes onto the sea stack and the sea arch (letter B); the fish pools between leaps; the urchin beds on
# foot; the feast kit; the strong blowhole on the rock onto the shoulder and the exit totem. Never presses S
# and never takes the axe (belt invariance).
# Re-recorded in wf10 by party with the same bot: raft.gd's drag clock now counts the ticks a raft dozed (it dragged on
# other ticks with dozing on than off - wf9_d6_to_objects-B.txt); the raft's speed steps moved by a few ticks.
